WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.930
Your friend sends a message: meet
me at the church on the map.

2
00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:05.250
You open the map.

3
00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:07.030
There are three churches.

4
00:00:07.080 --> 00:00:08.050
Which one?

5
00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:11.830
You and your friend try to name
the same square with numbers.

6
00:00:11.880 --> 00:00:14.550
One writes three four five six.

7
00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:17.430
The other writes five six three four.

8
00:00:17.480 --> 00:00:18.830
Can both be right?

9
00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:20.930
Which number should come first?

10
00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:23.990
In this mission, you'll
compare globes, atlases,

11
00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:26.630
Ordnance Survey maps and digital maps.

12
00:00:26.680 --> 00:00:30.470
You'll give four-figure and
six-figure grid references.

13
00:00:30.520 --> 00:00:34.070
And you'll find directions with
the eight points of the compass.

14
00:00:34.120 --> 00:00:39.300
Your mission: name one exact spot
on a map, using only numbers.
